<SiteLayout title="Micro Expression Trainer Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Micro Expression Trainer and Poker Face Lab by Kroma Digital.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span><h1>Micro Expression Trainer</h1><p>Privacy Policy for the Micro Expression Trainer Android application, including Poker Face Lab.</p></div></section>
<section class="content"><div class="wrap prose">
<p><strong>Last updated: November 14, 2026</strong></p>

<h2>1. About Micro Expression Trainer</h2>
<p>Micro Expression Trainer is an observation-training and entertainment app developed by Kroma Digital. It includes facial-expression training and Poker Face Lab, a poker-themed game featuring fictional, app-provided characters and facial-expression recognition challenges.</p>
<p>Poker Face Lab uses simulated poker gameplay and virtual game elements. It does not offer real-money gambling, cash prizes, or conversion of virtual chips into money or prizes.</p>
<p>Facial expressions alone cannot reliably determine a person's actual emotions, intentions, honesty, or truthfulness. The app is not a medical, psychological, biometric identification, or lie-detection tool.</p>

<h2>2. Accounts and personal information</h2>
<p>Micro Expression Trainer does not require users to create an account. Kroma Digital does not require users to provide their name, email address, phone number, or personal photographs to use the core training and game features.</p>
<p>Third-party services used by the app may process device or transaction information as explained below.</p>

<h2>3. Training data, game progress and app settings</h2>
<p>Information such as training scores, recognition performance, training history, Poker Face Lab results, tournament progress, unlocked stages, and app settings may be stored locally on the user's device.</p>
<p>Kroma Digital does not operate a dedicated server that receives or stores this locally maintained training and gameplay information.</p>
<p>Deleting the app or clearing its application data may remove locally stored progress and settings. Device backup features, if enabled, may operate according to the device and platform settings.</p>

<h2>4. Camera, photos and biometric data</h2>
<p>The app uses fictional, app-provided facial-expression images and characters. Its core training and Poker Face Lab features do not require access to the camera or photo library, and users are not required to upload personal facial images.</p>
<p>The app does not perform facial recognition, biometric identification, biometric authentication, or analysis of the user's own facial expressions.</p>

<h2>5. Advertising and Google AdMob</h2>
<p>Micro Expression Trainer uses Google AdMob and the Google Mobile Ads SDK to display advertisements, including optional rewarded advertisements that may be offered for retry or other game actions.</p>
<p>Google and its advertising services may process information for advertising delivery, measurement, security, and fraud prevention. Depending on device settings and applicable consent choices, this information may include:</p>
<ul>
<li>IP address and approximate location derived from it</li>
<li>Advertising ID and other device or app identifiers</li>
<li>Advertising impressions and interactions</li>
<li>Diagnostic, performance, and technical information</li>
</ul>
<p>Google processes this information under its applicable privacy policies. Kroma Digital does not receive users' personal facial images or biometric identifiers through the advertising implementation.</p>
<p>Users with an active Premium Upgrade entitlement can use the app without advertisements.</p>

<h2>6. In-app purchases and Premium Upgrade</h2>
<p>The app offers an optional, one-time Premium Upgrade through Google Play Billing. Premium features include access to Poker Face Lab Stages 6 and 7, removal of advertisements, and ad-free retries.</p>
<p>Google Play processes payment transactions. Kroma Digital does not directly collect or store full payment card numbers. Google Play and the app may process purchase status, transaction identifiers, or purchase tokens as necessary to complete or verify purchases and restore entitlements.</p>
<p>For details of Google's processing of purchase information, please refer to the Google Privacy Policy linked below.</p>

<h2>7. Internet access and third-party services</h2>
<p>The app may use an internet connection to request advertisements, process and verify in-app purchases, and restore Premium purchase entitlements.</p>
<p>Core facial-expression training content and fictional Poker Face Lab characters are provided within the app. Users do not need to upload their own facial images to use these features.</p>

<h2>8. Children's privacy</h2>
<p>Micro Expression Trainer does not knowingly request children to submit personal information directly to Kroma Digital. The app's Google Play target audience and advertising configuration are managed in accordance with applicable Google Play and Google advertising requirements.</p>
<p>Third-party services may process technical information as described in this policy.</p>

<h2>9. Third-party privacy information</h2>
<p>For more information about third-party data practices, see the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="https://admob.google.com/">Google AdMob</a>, and <a href="https://play.google.com/about/play-terms/">Google Play Terms of Service</a>.</p>

<h2>10. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
<p>This Privacy Policy may be updated when app features, third-party services, or data practices change. The latest version will be published on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

<h2>11. Contact</h2>
<p>For privacy questions, please contact Kroma Digital through the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
